      "<strong>v1.12 &mdash; /story page ported from openagenticv4 (first ship of the post-audit port-completeness sprint).</strong> Per the <code>Agentiport-Port-Audit.html</code> finding, <code>/story</code> was a P0 missing route &mdash; every Karen cold-email CTA links to <code>getrefill.app/story</code> for prospects who want the full founders narrative, and without it the cold-email funnel landed at a 404. Now lands at the canonical long-form version: hero (20+ years owning Rejuv, finally built the no-show fix) &rarr; the pain (Monday morning shuffling) &rarr; what we built (any scheduler + honest math + recovery engine) &rarr; the math (empty-slot leak only, defensible against books) &rarr; 3-step CTA card (export CSV &rarr; drop at getrefill.app &rarr; see real number) &rarr; pricing (free + 12% only on recovered, &lsquo;nothing nada zip zilch&rsquo; if no recovery) &rarr; conviction guarantee &rarr; scheduler coverage (24+ platforms) &rarr; closing (&lsquo;Whatever you decide, good luck on your med spa journey&rsquo;) &rarr; Karen + David signature &rarr; bottom CTA. Voice locked to Karen as primary author per <em>real-world-first-then-match</em>. <strong>Cleave changes during port</strong>: dropped <code>useShell()</code> + <code>brandFor()</code> shell-discriminator (refill-app is single-brand post-cleave; brandFor was deleted per <code>src/lib/brand.ts</code> comment block), inlined static <code>brand</code> import; translated 20+ Tailwind generic tokens (<code>slate-900</code>, <code>slate-700</code>, <code>slate-600</code>, <code>slate-500</code>, <code>slate-400</code>, <code>slate-50</code>, <code>slate-100</code>, <code>slate-200</code>, <code>emerald-700</code>, <code>emerald-50</code>, <code>emerald-100</code>, <code>amber-50</code>, <code>amber-200</code>, <code>amber-800</code>, <code>amber-900</code>, <code>bg-[#f8f6f1]</code>, <code>text-white</code>) to Refill brand tokens (<code>ink</code>, <code>ink-soft</code>, <code>ink-faint</code>, <code>emerald</code>, <code>emerald-soft</code>, <code>amber</code>, <code>amber-soft</code>, <code>paper</code>, <code>rule</code>, <code>rule-soft</code>) per v1.10-v1.11 brand-coherence work; flipped dark CTA blocks from <code>bg-slate-900 text-white</code> to <code>bg-emerald text-paper</code> matching the v1.11 sweep; softened card radii from <code>rounded-2xl</code> to <code>rounded-xl</code> per v1.10 polish convention. <strong>Critically NOT changed</strong>: every line of body copy stays verbatim from openagenticv4&rsquo;s v371.3 ship &mdash; voice consistency, pricing (12%), ARV ($250), 3-step CTA, &lsquo;Nothing nada zip zilch&rsquo; guarantee, peer-to-peer closing all preserved exactly. <strong>Cross-references that now resolve</strong>: all Karen cold-email templates referencing <code>getrefill.app/story</code> (Pack v1 + Playbook V1-V5), <code>Refill-Cold-Email.html</code>&rsquo;s P.S. link, future <code>Karen-Onboarding-Loom-Script.html</code> embedded link below founders section, /scan&rsquo;s downstream &lsquo;learn more&rsquo; CTA. Touched: <code>src/routes/story.tsx</code> (new file, 282 lines), <code>src/lib/changelog.ts</code> (this entry).",
